達成を目標としています。　詳しくは、2026年５月７日付け公表資料「ビジョン2030」をご参照ください。　なお、2027年３月期は、ビジョン2030の初年度として、ネオキャリアを実現（11月24日予定）し、商用サービスを開始したFPoSの普及を進めるとともに、競争力の源泉であるデジタル認証基盤をさらに強化していきます。", null, "NextYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_ForecastMember"], ["SignificantChangesInTheScopeOfConsolidationDuringThePeriod", "SignificantChangesInTheScopeOfConsolidationDuringThePeriod", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "無", null, "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["ChangesBasedOnRevisionsOfAccountingStandard", "ChangesBasedOnRevisionsOfAccountingStandard", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "無", null, "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["ChangesOtherThanOnesBasedOnRevisionsOfAccountingStandard", "ChangesOtherThanOnesBasedOnRevisionsOfAccountingStandard", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "無", null, "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["ChangesInAccountingEstimates", "ChangesInAccountingEstimates", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "無", null, "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["RetrospectiveRestatement", "RetrospectiveRestatement", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "無", null, "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["期末発行済株式数", "NumberOfIssuedAndOutstandingSharesAtTheEndOfFiscalYearIncludingTreasuryStock", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", 166838739, "166,838,739", "Shares", "CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["期末発行済株式数", "NumberOfIssuedAndOutstandingSharesAtTheEndOfFiscalYearIncludingTreasuryStock", "tse-ed-t", "前期末", 165923739, "165,923,739", "Shares", "PriorYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["期末自己株式数", "NumberOfTreasuryStockAtTheEndOfFiscalYear", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", 29504, "29,504", "Shares", "CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["期末自己株式数", "NumberOfTreasuryStockAtTheEndOfFiscalYear", "tse-ed-t", "前期末", 15004, "15,004", "Shares", "PriorYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember_ResultMember"], ["期中平均株式数", "AverageNumberOfShares", "tse-ed-t", "当期", 166546899, "166,546,899", "Shares", "CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedM